Third-party components redistributed in this repository:

* phreeqc/phreeqc.exe and phreeqc/phreeqc.dat
  PHREEQC version 3.8.6, U.S. Geological Survey.
  PHREEQC is in the public domain (no copyright, US Government work).
  See https://www.usgs.gov/software/phreeqc-version-3

* phreeqc/build_phreeqc.sh downloads and builds PHREEQC from the
  official USGS source distribution.

The thermodynamic database phreeqc.dat is the official USGS distribution
shipped with PHREEQC 3.8.6; its header records the upstream build path.